{"unit_id":"tag:06YL:prose-0004","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n此定义意味着，对每个 <MATH_0001>-模（modules）的短正合列（short exact sequence）\n<MATH_0002>\n有长正合（long exact）上同调（cohomology）序列（sequence）\n<MATH_0003>\n对每个 <MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005> 均如此。这称为与该情形关联的 <MATH_0006> 的长正合列（exact sequence）。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"正合列对象"},{"source_term":"short exact sequence","target_term":"短正合列","context":"给定的模序列"},{"source_term":"long exact","target_term":"长正合","context":"上同调序列的性质"},{"source_term":"cohomology","target_term":"上同调","context":"导出张量积上同调"},{"source_term":"sequence","target_term":"序列","context":"上同调序列"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"张量因子"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列","context":"关联的 Tor 长正合列"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08FG:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 <MATH_0003>-模（module）。以下条件等价（equivalent）：\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0004> 为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0005>-模（module），以及\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0006> 对每个 <MATH_0007>-模（module）<MATH_0008> 成立。\n<STRUCT_0004>\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"equivalent","target_term":"等价","context":"两个条件的等价性"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模平坦性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:08FG:proof","translation":"若 <MATH_0001> 平坦（flat），则 <MATH_0002> 为正合（exact）函子（functor），其卫星函子（satellites）消失。反之，假设 (2) 成立。那么，若 <MATH_0003> 是单射的（injective），余核（cokernel）为 <MATH_0004>，则 <MATH_0005> 的长正合列（exact sequence）表明，\n<MATH_0006>\n的核（kernel）是\n<MATH_0007>\n的商（quotient），而后者由假设为零。因此 <MATH_0008> 平坦（flat）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子"},{"source_term":"satellites","target_term":"卫星函子"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"模平坦性"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"张量函子正合性"},{"source_term":"functor","target_term":"函子","context":"张量函子"},{"source_term":"satellites","target_term":"卫星函子","context":"张量函子的卫星函子"},{"source_term":"injective","target_term":"单射的","context":"模映射单射性"},{"source_term":"cokernel","target_term":"余核","context":"模映射余核"},{"source_term":"exact sequence","target_term":"长正合列","context":"关联 Tor 序列"},{"source_term":"kernel","target_term":"核","context":"张量映射的核"},{"source_term":"quotient","target_term":"商","context":"核作为 Tor 的商"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7C:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）、无上同调（acyclic）的复形（complex），其各项（terms）平坦（flat）。则\n<MATH_0003>\n为平坦（flat）的 <MATH_0004>-模（module）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"复形性质"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调","context":"上同调消失"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"给定复形"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"各项及结论模的平坦性"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"结论中的模"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7C:proof","translation":"注意，\n<MATH_0001>\n是我们的模（module）<MATH_0002> 的平坦（flat）分解（resolution）。由于由平坦模（flat modules）组成的上有界（bounded above）复形（complex）是 K-平坦（K-flat）的（引理 <REF_0001>），可用此分解（resolution）计算 <MATH_0003>，对任意 <MATH_0004>-模（module）<MATH_0005> 均如此。一方面，\n<MATH_0006>\n在 <MATH_0007> 中为零，因为 <MATH_0008> 无上同调（acyclic）；另一方面，它由 <MATH_0009> 代表（represented）。因此可见\n<MATH_0010>\n正合（exact）。从而 <MATH_0011>，由引理 <REF_0002> 得出结论。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解"},{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"代表"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"module","target_term":"模","context":"待证平坦的模及张量因子"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"分解各项的性质"},{"source_term":"resolution","target_term":"分解","context":"计算 Tor 的分解"},{"source_term":"flat modules","target_term":"平坦模","context":"分解各项"},{"source_term":"bounded above","target_term":"上有界","context":"分解复形有界性"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"分解复形"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"分解复形性质"},{"source_term":"acyclic","target_term":"无上同调","context":"复形消失性质"},{"source_term":"represented","target_term":"代表","context":"导出范畴对象的代表"},{"source_term":"exact","target_term":"正合","context":"结论中的正合性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7D:statement","translation":"设 <MATH_0001> 为赋环位点（ringed site）。设 <MATH_0002> 为复形（complexes）的映射（map），这些复形由 <MATH_0003>-模（modules）组成。若 <MATH_0004> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的，则存在复形（complex）<MATH_0005> 及复形（complexes）的映射（maps）<MATH_0006> 和 <MATH_0007>，使得\n<STRUCT_0001>\n<STRUCT_0002> <MATH_0008> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的，\n<STRUCT_0003> <MATH_0009> 为拟同构（quasi-isomorphism），\n<STRUCT_0004> <MATH_0010> 同伦于（homotopic to）<MATH_0011>。\n<STRUCT_0005>\n若 <MATH_0012> 的各项（terms）平坦（flat），则可选取 <MATH_0013>、<MATH_0014> 及 <MATH_0015>，使 <MATH_0016> 也具有这一性质。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"homotopic to","target_term":"同伦于"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"ringed site","target_term":"赋环位点","context":"底层位点"},{"source_term":"complexes","target_term":"复形","context":"映射两端复形"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射","context":"给定复形映射"},{"source_term":"modules","target_term":"模","context":"系数模"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦","context":"复形性质"},{"source_term":"complex","target_term":"复形","context":"构造复形"},{"source_term":"maps","target_term":"映射","context":"构造映射"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构","context":"构造映射性质"},{"source_term":"homotopic to","target_term":"同伦于","context":"复合映射的同伦关系"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项","context":"复形各项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦","context":"复形各项平坦性"}],"notes":[]}
{"unit_id":"tag:0G7D:proof","translation":"我们将使用同伦范畴（homotopy category）<MATH_0001> 是三角范畴（triangulated category）这一事实，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》命题 <REF_0001>。选取区别三角（distinguished triangle）<MATH_0002>。选取拟同构（quasi-isomorphism）<MATH_0003>，其中 <MATH_0004> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的，且各项（terms）平坦（flat），见引理 <REF_0002>。由三角范畴（triangulated categories）的公理（axioms），可将复合（composition）\n<MATH_0005>\n纳入区别三角（distinguished triangle）<MATH_0006>。由引理 <REF_0003> 可见，<MATH_0007> 为 K-平坦（K-flat）的。再次使用三角范畴（triangulated categories）的公理（axioms），可选取映射（map）<MATH_0008>，纳入以下区别三角（distinguished triangles）的态射（morphism）\n<MATH_0009>\n由于三个箭头（arrows）中有两个为拟同构（quasi-isomorphisms），第三个箭头（arrow）<MATH_0010> 也是，这由关联于这些区别三角（distinguished triangles）的上同调（cohomology）长正合列（exact sequences）得出（也可考察此图式（diagram）在 <MATH_0011> 中的像（image），并使用《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0004>）。这完成了 (1)、(2) 和 (3) 的证明。为证明最后的断言，可选取 <MATH_0012>，使 <MATH_0013>，见《导出范畴（Derived Categories）》引理 <REF_0005>。因此，若 <MATH_0014> 的各项（terms）平坦（flat），就得到所需的平坦性（flatness）。\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"homotopy category","target_term":"同伦范畴"},{"source_term":"triangulated category","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"Derived Categories","target_term":"导出范畴"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"quasi-isomorphism","target_term":"拟同构"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"terms","target_term":"项"},{"source_term":"flat","target_term":"平坦"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"axioms","target_term":"公理"},{"source_term":"composition","target_term":"复合"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangle","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"K-flat","target_term":"K-平坦"},{"source_term":"triangulated categories","target_term":"三角范畴"},{"source_term":"axioms","target_term":"公理"},{"source_term":"map","target_term":"映射"},{"source_term":"distinguished triangles","target_term":"区别三角"},{"source_term":"morphism","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"arrows","targe